      "physical_description": null,
      "summary": "Pair of earrings of silver and coral of kneedlepoint design. Each earring is articulated into three sections. The section going into the ear is a fan shape made of small half moon slivers of coral set into silver bezels so that the curved part is raised and backed onto silver sheet which is cut out.  To this a further, larger, fan shape of (7) set of sliver of half  moon shaped coral is attached by a jump ring, and a further set of (12) coral slivers set in a silver bezels forms the last pendulant half moon shape. This latter is edged with twisted silver wire and attached to the second with a jump ring.  All rows of bezels have silver beads.",
